  "plain": "A military veteran named Mario Woods tells a podcast host, Jesse Michels, that around March 2023 he reported an incident he was part of to AARO, the Pentagon office set up to look into reports of unidentified objects. He says AARO never followed up, and that a man named Michael Johnson, tied to the incident, was never found. He tells it as a sign that the office did not take such reports seriously."
